# .qualityignore — accepted exclusions from quality gates.
#
# Each entry is an exact repository-relative path, a trailing-slash directory name,
# or a shell-style glob, with a comment naming its reason. Entries are debt: the
# audit re-checks ignored paths every run and drops entries that no longer apply.
# Adding or broadening an entry is a policy decision requiring explicit user
# authorization; it never appears hidden inside an implementation refactor.
#
# This repo has no generated, vendored, or unchangeable paths to exclude. Empty by
# design — do not add entries without approval.
